{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20048","headline":"大隐坊 崔从事郧以直隳职 · 孟郊","name":"大隐坊 崔从事郧以直隳职","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"古人留清风，千载遥赠君。\n破松见贞心，裂竹见直文。\n残月色不改，高贤德常新。\n家怀诗书富，宅抱草木贫。\n安得一蹄泉，来化千尺鳞。\n含意永不语，钓璜幽水滨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20048.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20048","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}